{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29145","headline":"酬副使郑端公见寄 · 许浑","name":"酬副使郑端公见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一日高名遍九州，玄珠仍向道中求。\n郢中白雪慙新唱，涂上青山忆旧游。\n笙磬有文终易别，珠玑无价竟难酬。\n柳营迢遰江风阔，夜夜孤吟月下楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}